  "title": "VAREX TO PRESENT AT THE JEFFERIES GLOBAL HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE",
  "summary": "SALT LAKE CITY, May 28, 2026 – Varex Imaging Corporation (Nasdaq: VREX) announced today that management is scheduled to present at the Jefferies Global Healthcare Conference in New York. Management will participate in a fireside chat presentation on Wednesday, June 3, 2026 at 3:10 pm ET. The presentation will be webcast and can be accessed […]",
